# Secrets — never committed, never printed, never logged (CLAUDE.md rule 4, CONTEXT §4.3)
.env

# Local stores, caches and run artifacts.
#
# THE STORES NO LONGER LIVE HERE. As of 02-Aug-2026 the mutable stores are OUTSIDE this
# repository tree, at paths.data_root / paths.cache_root in config.yaml — CLAUDE.md,
# "Data-store safety", Q-18 layer 1: no git command can reach them. Gitignoring them was
# never enough; on 31-Jul-2026 `git worktree remove --force` followed two NTFS junctions
# into in-repo data/ and cache/ and emptied both, and every ignore rule below was in force
# at the time (QUESTIONS.md Q-18, CONTEXT §4.6).
#
# The two entries are KEPT as a belt: if a stray data/ or cache/ ever reappears under the
# repo root it must still never be committed. The loader refuses an in-repo store root, so
# nothing this project writes can create one.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash ON PURPOSE: an unanchored "data/" would also ignore
# poc/data/, and those CSVs are FROZEN GOLDEN FIXTURES that must stay tracked (CONTEXT §8 F7/F10).
/data/
/cache/
/logs/
poc/cache/

# Python build / test artifacts
__pycache__/
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache/
